      "prompt": "The source contains GrossSales and Cost. A Rename Columns step creates SalesAmount from GrossSales, then a later Add Column step calculates Margin using [SalesAmount] - [Cost]. Someone reorders the rename step to run after Add Column. What is the expected result if the expression is not changed?",
