      "exam_objective": "Prepare the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Profile and clean the data",
      "prompt": "The source `[Amount]` column contains `\"150\"`, `\"90\"`, and `\"N/A\"`; a Changed Type to Decimal produces one Error. Which approach best preserves analytical trust?",
