      "topic": "Precision decisions",
      "exam_objective": "Prepare the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data",
      "prompt": "A logistics fact stores package quantities 2.0, 2.5, and 3.0; the 2.5 quantity is contractually valid. A developer proposes changing Quantity from Decimal Number to Whole Number merely to simplify the display. What is the primary concern?",
      "type": "single",
      "difficulty": 4,
      "code": "",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Use Whole Number, then specify two decimals in the report formatting."
