      "topic": "Rounding vs formatting",
      "exam_objective": "Prepare the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data",
      "prompt": "A pricing file stores UnitPrice=0.1255 and Quantity=1,000,000. A report shows unit prices to two decimal places, but finance calculates extended revenue using the full four-decimal input. What is the safest design?",
