      "exam_objective": "Prepare the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data",
      "prompt": "A finance source has UnitPrice 0.1255 and Qty 1,000,000. The approved policy is to calculate extended amounts at source precision, then round the final monetary posting. Which pipeline avoids an early-rounding error?",
