      "exam_objective": "Prepare the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Profile and clean the data",
      "prompt": "An Amount column contains values `\"12.50\"`, `\"N/A\"`, and `\"8.00\"`. A new Changed Type step replaces conversion errors with null. The refresh now contains one more null than the source. How should the analyst establish its cause before accepting the model?",
