      "exam_objective": "Prepare the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data",
      "prompt": "Staging query Raw_Orders cleans a SQL extract. Two referenced queries, Sales and Returns, are model tables. Raw_Orders should not appear as another table in the semantic model. Select TWO appropriate actions.",
