      "exam_objective": "Prepare the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data",
      "prompt": "An analyst selects the `Removed Columns` Applied Step and sees a narrower Power Query preview. The final step later adds a derived column. They want the final query result in their Power BI Desktop model, not an update to the SQL source. Which action has the intended effect?",
