      "exam_objective": "Prepare the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data",
      "prompt": "TicketEvents has rows (T1, Open, 1 Oct), (T1, Closed, 3 Oct), (T2, Open, 2 Oct). The report must show one current status per ticket AND complete status-change history. What model design is defensible?",
