      "exam_objective": "Prepare the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Profile and clean the data",
      "prompt": "FactSales contains 20,000 otherwise valid invoices, including 4,000 with null CustomerName but known InvoiceID and Revenue. Finance requires complete revenue totals and a separate quality KPI for customer attribution. Select TWO actions that meet both goals.",
