      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data",
      "prompt": "A CSV feed changed folder, switched to dd/MM/yyyy dates, added unfamiliar country aliases, and contains repeated OrderIDs because one order has several line items. Select THREE actions required for the initial source-and-grain recovery before a separate governed country-alias mapping is applied.",
