      "exam_objective": "Prepare the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Profile and clean the data",
      "prompt": "A Power Query M column has exactly four source rows: null, \"\", \"   \" (three spaces), and \"Unknown\". The business rule retains \"Unknown\" as an actual category but treats whitespace-only entries as missing. Select TWO statements consistent with M.",
