        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "A label should be chosen for reporting semantics; a long dummy string is not automatically the best representation."
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Persisting a long optional text category may add unnecessary storage/semantics; measure compression impact rather than assuming it."
