      "prompt": "In SourceCustomers, key ' Acme ' and 'ACME' refer to the same approved organization; LookupOrganizations contains 'Acme' and 'Acme  ' as separate records. A trim/case-normalization would produce duplicate lookup keys. What is the defensible reconciliation BEFORE a left merge into 10,000 invoice rows?",
