      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data — Merge and append queries",
      "prompt": "Customers has unique codes {C1,C2,C3,C4}; AllowList has {C2,C4}. Compliance wants precisely {C1,C3}, with no permitted customers and no unmatched rows from the allowlist. Which join should it use with Customers as the left table?",
