      "exam_objective": "Prepare the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data — Merge and append queries",
      "prompt": "Region East has ShipmentID 0007 once and West has ShipmentID 0007 once. East also mistakenly repeats (East,0007) on a second source row. Business confirms IDs reset by region. How should the post-append deduplication key be defined?",
      "type": "single",
