      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data — Pivot, unpivot and transpose data",
      "prompt": "After unpivoting a monthly export, Attribute contains `Mar Revenue`, `Mar Shipping Cost`, `Apr Revenue`, and `Apr Shipping Cost`. The output needs separate Month and Metric, including the two-word metric. What transformation best retains meaning?",
