      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data — Pivot, unpivot and transpose data",
      "prompt": "Raw quality events have fields EventID, Site, Status, Score. There may be 30 events per Site-Status; EventID is never blank. A pivot uses Status as headers and needs the number of original events, not a score average. Which aggregation should be applied to EventID?",
