      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data — Pivot, unpivot and transpose data",
      "prompt": "Source columns are CustomerID, Jan and Feb. A query selects only CustomerID, then Unpivot Other Columns. A new descriptive Segment field is added upstream next month, but the report needs Segment as a customer attribute. What regression can occur on refresh?",
