      "topic": "Pivot mechanics",
      "exam_objective": "Prepare the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data — Pivot, unpivot and transpose data",
      "prompt": "The source columns are Department, Jan Actual, Feb Actual, Jan Target and Feb Target. Only Actuals should become Month–Actual rows; Target columns must remain wide even if a Mar Target column appears. Which operation is safest?",
      "type": "single",
      "difficulty": 4,
      "code": "",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Select Department and use Unpivot Other Columns so all numeric columns become Actual rows."
