      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data — Pivot, unpivot and transpose data",
      "prompt": "A Power Query pivot groups records by Account and makes Month the column dimension; Amount is aggregated with Sum. The source contains (A,Jan,10), (A,Jan,15), and (A,Feb,5). What is Account A in the Jan output column?",
      "type": "single",
