      "topic": "Reshaping fundamentals",
      "exam_objective": "Prepare the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data — Pivot, unpivot and transpose data",
      "prompt": "Customer C7 arrives in one wide row: SalesJan=100, CostJan=60, SalesFeb=80, CostFeb=50. You need a normalized Customer-Month-Metric-Value table with four records. Select TWO transformations to establish that shape.",
      "type": "multi",
