      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data — Pivot, unpivot and transpose data",
      "prompt": "For Customer A, the source contains Jan=40, Feb=60 and Grand Total=100. Unpivot Other Columns is performed with only Customer fixed; the model then sums Value. What should the analyst change to prevent an inflated customer total?",
      "type": "single",
