      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data — Pivot, unpivot and transpose data",
      "prompt": "A file has Jan=70, Feb=30 and GrandTotal=100 for each store. An Unpivot Other Columns operation would convert all three fields into period rows. Select TWO controls that protect the monthly-revenue report from double counting.",
      "type": "multi",
