      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data — Reference versus duplicate queries",
      "prompt": "Two report tables repeat 35 identical customer-cleaning steps but diverge for final segmentation. A new PII-masking rule must be maintained once and used in both, without claiming a shared refresh cache. What refactor fits?",
