      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data — Reference versus duplicate queries",
      "prompt": "A project groups 30 queries into Staging, Dimensions and Facts in the Queries pane. The team claims moving all Staging queries to one group ensures the API is called once. Which response follows Power Query execution semantics?",
