      "exam_objective": "Prepare the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Transform and load the data — Reference versus duplicate queries",
      "prompt": "SQL steps Source → Filter → AddCustomColumn are used in Power Query. View Native Query is disabled on AddCustomColumn, while earlier steps may fold. The connector supports query plan diagnostics. Which investigation avoids overclaiming?",
