      "exam_subobjective": "Design and implement a data model / Optimize model performance",
      "prompt": "A 1.2-million-row CustomerEvents table has one row per customer interaction, while a 2.5-million-row DimProduct table has one row per product variant and its descriptions. Which determines fact versus dimension?",
