      "exam_objective": "Model the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Design and implement a data model / Optimize model performance",
      "prompt": "InventorySnapshot records one warehouse and SKU at end of each day: Monday = 8 units, Tuesday = 11, Wednesday = 7. A chart sums these rows to show Closing Stock = 26. What correction is required?",
