      "exam_subobjective": "Design and implement a data model / Optimize model performance",
      "prompt": "Orders has 250 order headers; OrderLines contains 900 line items, each with an ItemKey and NetAmount. Finance needs revenue by Item, Category and customer without allocating header totals arbitrarily. At what grain should the revenue fact be defined?",
