      "prompt": "FactInventory stores one record per (Date,Warehouse,Product) at 23:59. For SKU P, warehouse W, stock is 12 on Monday and 14 on Tuesday. A card asks for end-of-day stock on Tuesday, not units observed over the two days. What aggregation logic is appropriate?",
