      "exam_objective": "Model the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Design and implement a data model",
      "prompt": "DimCustomer and FactSales are related in Model view; a customer Segment slicer filters sales totals. There was no Power Query merge and both imported tables stay separate. Why does the filter work?",
      "type": "single",
