      "prompt": "A Customer (1) → Sales (*) relationship has Single cross-filter direction. A between-range slicer is built from Sales[Amount] and filters fact rows, while another slicer is built directly from Customer[CustomerName] without a fact measure filter. Customer names do not disappear as amounts are selected. What explains this?",
