      "exam_subobjective": "Design and implement a data model",
      "prompt": "A report has a list that should show customers with at least one transaction during the selected month, but other pages must still allow all customers. Customer→Sales is Single, and Dates filters Sales. Which approach scopes the list without modifying the model-wide relationship?",
