      "exam_subobjective": "Design and implement a data model",
      "prompt": "A role restricts DimCustomer to assigned customers. A developer sets the Customer↔Sales relationship's ordinary cross-filter direction to Both, asserting that this alone makes security flow bidirectionally across every table. What is the proper response?",
