      "exam_subobjective": "Design and implement a data model",
      "prompt": "RLS on DimGeography restricts one Viewer to Region North. Both FactSales and FactReturns carry GeographyID, but Returns has no Geography relationship. A report hides Returns[Amount] from the field list. What is the correct security remediation?",
