      "topic": "Field hygiene — Don't summarize",
      "exam_objective": "Model the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Design and implement a data model",
      "prompt": "OrderID is a numeric business identifier (e.g., 10021), not an additive measure. In a report detail table it defaults to Sum and users need to inspect individual IDs. Which field treatment fits?",
