      "exam_objective": "Model the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Design and implement a data model",
      "prompt": "Customers contains A, B, C. Sales has the rows (Customer, Channel, Amount): (A, Store, 20), (A, Online, 40), (B, Store, 80), (B, Online, 20), (C, Online, 40). An active Single relationship runs Customer(1) → Sales(*). A Sales[Channel] = Store filter is applied; the customer-name visual contains only Customer[Name] and no fact measure. Which outcome is correct?",
