      "exam_objective": "Model the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Design and implement a data model",
      "prompt": "Customers contains A and B. The model has an active Customer(1) → Sales(*) relationship with Single cross-filter direction; Both is NOT enabled. A report filter reduces Sales to B rows. A customer-name visual uses only Customer[Name], with no fact measure or other filters. Which customer context remains?",
