      "scope": "Course concept deepened with applied Microsoft Learn scenario",
      "topic": "Testing behaviour in Report view",
      "exam_objective": "Model the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Design and implement a data model",
      "prompt": "Customer (1) → Sales (*) is active, and a Customer table visual is set to be cross-filtered (not merely highlighted) by a Sales channel visual. After changing relationship direction from Single to Both, selecting Channel=\"Online\" narrows Customer rows to buyers with Online sales. Why?",
      "type": "single",
