      "exam_objective": "Model the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Design and implement a data model",
      "prompt": "A Products dimension has two rows for ProductID=6: Version 1 valid through June 2025 and Version 2 valid after that date. Sales from both periods must retain as-was Category analysis. What relationship-key repair is appropriate?",
