      "exam_objective": "Model the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Design and implement a data model",
      "prompt": "DimProduct contains ProductKey 1 and 2; Sales has three rows: (1,10),(2,20),(99,30). An active, regular 1:* Product→Sales relationship exists. Report grouping by Product[Name] shows a blank bucket. Select TWO diagnostic conclusions/actions supported by the fixture.",
      "type": "multi",
      "difficulty": 4,
      "code": "DimProduct keys:1,2. FactSales rows: (1,10),(2,20),(99,30). Product[Name] blank bucket may be virtual due to unmatched key 99; 30 contributes.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "A hidden dimension row ProductKey=99 must exist, because a blank grouping always uses a physical blank record."
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "The unmatched ProductKey=99 row must have zero SalesAmount by definition."
        },
        {
