      "exam_objective": "Model the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Design and implement a data model",
      "prompt": "FactSales has an active OrderDate→Date relationship and an inactive ShipDate→Date relationship. A measure must calculate shipped revenue using the common Date slicer, without changing the model default. Assume the measure is allowed under the model's security context. Which DAX expression selects the intended date role?",
