      "prompt": "Date[Date] has an ACTIVE relationship to Sales[OrderDate] and an INACTIVE relationship to Sales[ShipDate]. The team needs a shipped-revenue measure with Date slicers, while existing order-date reports must remain unchanged. What is the least invasive DAX design?",
