      "exam_objective": "Model the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Design and implement a data model",
      "prompt": "One Date slicer must control OrderRevenue and ShipRevenue on the same page. Date→Sales[OrderDate] is active, Date→Sales[ShipDate] exists but is inactive, and no RLS roles apply. What implementation meets both measures without duplicating Date?",
