      "exam_objective": "Model the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Design and implement a data model",
      "prompt": "A model contains ONLY an inactive relationship Sales[ShipDate]→'Date'[Date]; no relationship uses Sales[InvoiceDate]. A measure references USERELATIONSHIP(Sales[InvoiceDate],'Date'[Date]). What is the direct fix, if shipped revenue was intended?",
