      "exam_subobjective": "Create and manage workspaces and assets — configure semantic model scheduled refresh and gateways",
      "prompt": "A published imported semantic model reads a CSV on an on-premises file server. The Power BI service cannot directly reach that server. The owner needs automatic daily data updates without opening Desktop. Which solution is appropriate?",
      "type": "single",
      "difficulty": 4,
      "code": "",
