      "exam_objective": "Model the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Design and implement a semantic model — create model relationships",
      "prompt": "Two imported tables, Customers and Orders, are visible in a large semantic model. The analyst needs to identify columns and see which ones are connected by relationships without examining individual transaction rows. Where should the analyst work?",
      "type": "single",
