      "exam_subobjective": "Normalize appended dimension key fields",
      "prompt": "A modeller appends two query extracts using columns SellerID and ManagerID without aligning them. The result has separate sparsely populated ID columns. A relationship to the intended EmployeeID fails validation. What is the sound fix?",
