          "id": "C",
          "text": "Import models are disk-only, so they do not put pressure on capacity memory."
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Remove unused columns and reduce unnecessarily high cardinality to help reduce the compressed Import model footprint."
        }
      ],
      "gradingEnabled": false
