      "exam_objective": "Model the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Prevent denominator from ignoring intended time context",
      "prompt": "A report shows each Category revenue as share of *selected-year* revenue. The numerator obeys Year and Category filters, but the denominator uses `CALCULATE([Revenue], REMOVEFILTERS())`. Why can displayed shares be far below the selected-year proportions?",
