      "sourceId": "PL300-SUPP-V80-043",
      "legacy_id": "PBI-V22-ROLEPLAY-015",
      "topic": "Concurrent order and shipment date slicing",
      "exam_objective": "Model the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Concurrent order and shipment date slicing",
      "prompt": "Operations needs two independent report slicers: OrderMonth and ShipMonth, and one measure to display actual shipped revenue under both restrictions simultaneously. The fact contains both OrderDate and ShipDate, and current one Date table has an active OrderDate path and inactive ShipDate path. What model architecture best supports the simultaneous independent slicers?",
