        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "An inactive relationship automatically enforces RLS more strongly than an active one."
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "RLS uses active filter propagation, and USERELATIONSHIP has restrictions in security-constrained calculations; verify the security design rather than assuming the measure creates secure paths."
        },
