      "exam_objective": "Model the data",
      "exam_subobjective": "Snapshot as-of measure",
      "prompt": "A finance fact contains one balance record per bank account on sporadic reporting dates, and some accounts have no record on the last calendar day. The report needs each account’s most recent available balance as of slicer date. What is crucial?",
      "type": "single",
      "difficulty": "APPLIED_SCENARIO_PROVISIONAL",
