        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "RLS applies only to an imported Excel workbook, never a Power BI model."
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Workspace Admin, Member and Contributor roles are not restricted by semantic-model RLS in the same way as Viewer consumers."
