      "exam_subobjective": "Dataset refresh versus report repaint",
      "prompt": "A published Import model refreshes at 06:00 daily. At 09:00 a report is opened, showing values from the last successful refresh. Users want source changes made at 08:00 without waiting for the next scheduled import. What must change?",
