      "exam_objective": "Manage and secure Power BI",
      "exam_subobjective": "Direct Lake licensing and feasibility",
      "prompt": "An analyst proposes Direct Lake for a new model, but the source data lives only in an on-prem SQL Server, with no appropriate OneLake Delta tables or eligible capacity configured. What should be checked before selecting that mode?",
