          "text": "Change the SQL Server query to Import without creating any OneLake data."
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Check OneLake Delta data, eligible capacity, and Direct Lake support."
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Enable incremental refresh on the SQL query to provision Direct Lake storage."
        }
